Subject: [PATCH] fix(bore): setlocalversion short-version suppress (v1 shape, <=6.6.58)

Same edit for the pre-rewrite scripts/setlocalversion shape
(git-describe based, 4-tab indent, GKI pins <=6.6.58). Selected by
scripts/bore_compat_apply.sh.
---
diff --git a/scripts/setlocalversion b/scripts/setlocalversion
index 38b96c6..1236da2 100755
--- a/scripts/setlocalversion
+++ b/scripts/setlocalversion
@@ -92,7 +92,7 @@ scm_version()
